WEBVTT

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.768
That's baseball.

00:05:00.792 --> 00:05:02.653
But could you imagine 
a different world

00:05:02.667 --> 00:05:04.351
in which, in baseball,

00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:08.643
there were actually 13 innings,
or 14 innings, not just nine.

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:10.893
But we just had a weird tradition.

00:05:10.917 --> 00:05:13.476
If you are behind in the ninth inning,

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.643
you just come out and concede.

00:05:15.667 --> 00:05:16.934
Alright?

00:05:16.958 --> 00:05:19.143
So all those other innings don't matter.

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:23.351
That's really how the presidential
elections work in America.

00:05:23.375 --> 00:05:25.559
Because the constitution
actually spells out

00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:27.559
two different sets of innings.

00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:31.018
You've got the popular election process
that everybody pays attention to.